Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, kmod, systemd, udev, uke-kernel-touch-thp-abi-1
Description: native Uke Novatek NT36532 touch processing
 Preserves exact device, panel, geometry and private-input admission guards.
 Shared Apache-licensed processing is imported at its pinned revision with
 Uke geometry and bounded tracking patches. No private calibration is shipped.
